    "name": "Innocence Or Money | Season 2 | Episode 1",
    "steam_appid": 3064420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/9b02b071dd2766f3843f8fdc720bc5af.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=256 /></span><br><br><strong>Jennifer's adventures continue...</strong><br><br>Jennifer's adventures continue in the long-awaited second season of Innocence Or Money. What decisions have you made for Jennifer and where have you been leading her? <br><br>Continue to guide her down the path of innocence or money and witness the consequences that your decisions will bring to her life.<br><br>Season 2 includes many new and improved features to enhance the IoM experience further. For example:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enhanced music player:</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/12adaef340ca627c8418f173e5a05fc8.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>Season 2 includes a brand new, high-quality soundtrack and 100% original songs. Some of the innovations of the new music player are:<br><br>(1) Now, you can select whether you want the music to play in random order.<br>(2) Now, you can pause a song at any time and continue listening to it where you left off.<br>(3) The currently playing song will be displayed in the upper right corner of the player.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Season 2 includes an inventory system which will be used and expanded in the new episodes of the game:</strong></h2><br>The inventory system will be included in episode 1, and will become more and more useful in future episodes, allowing you to buy, use, etc. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/35deeb97ac343715df391434175eaca2.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=400 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The map will continue to expand with new locations during the development of the second season:</strong></h2><br>More locations and functionalities will be added to the map during the development of the second season.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/042aec5088f76c9bdfa912011831c9dd.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/cdf2cc847e378250bb560b1a9678bcaa.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>In addition to new locations, there will also be new characters added to the story:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/6e6cead2fd49cd77ff875a2663e029c7.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple improvements:</strong></h2><br>Season 2 improves every aspect and creates a new foundation on which each episode of this new season will be built, allowing it to take the game to a new level. Even the already known locations have had improvements which will allow to add a new layer of interactivity. (With each episode, you will see how new functionality will be added to IoM)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/b62560fafe13f03601de75654b8e79f1.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/81ba97a82c217ce342095250bfed65cf.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/06bbbbd9a01b3ac3346ea985da657f6e.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/feadd15d5015ad7d1cbf3820ad7ef27e.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now available in 32 Languages:</strong></h2><br>The list of languages in which IoM is available has been further expanded. Season 2 will be available in 32 languages, and even more languages may be added during development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/db18a58ea14e6baabeda621075752110.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue the story where you left off:</strong></h2><br>It is recommended to have played season 1 as season 2 is the continuation of the story, the game will start with a quiz for you to indicate the choices you made for Jennifer in season 1, once you select all the options, season 2 will start where season 1 ended.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/5ea994de3f8173f0b6b603a596fff6b1.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>Jennifer is waiting for you...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/b2f6b6592768ea28a980ff2d3a59ad12.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/9b02b071dd2766f3843f8fdc720bc5af.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=256 /></span><br><br><strong>Jennifer's adventures continue...</strong><br><br>Jennifer's adventures continue in the long-awaited second season of Innocence Or Money. What decisions have you made for Jennifer and where have you been leading her? <br><br>Continue to guide her down the path of innocence or money and witness the consequences that your decisions will bring to her life.<br><br>Season 2 includes many new and improved features to enhance the IoM experience further. For example:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enhanced music player:</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/12adaef340ca627c8418f173e5a05fc8.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>Season 2 includes a brand new, high-quality soundtrack and 100% original songs. Some of the innovations of the new music player are:<br><br>(1) Now, you can select whether you want the music to play in random order.<br>(2) Now, you can pause a song at any time and continue listening to it where you left off.<br>(3) The currently playing song will be displayed in the upper right corner of the player.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Season 2 includes an inventory system which will be used and expanded in the new episodes of the game:</strong></h2><br>The inventory system will be included in episode 1, and will become more and more useful in future episodes, allowing you to buy, use, etc. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/35deeb97ac343715df391434175eaca2.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=400 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The map will continue to expand with new locations during the development of the second season:</strong></h2><br>More locations and functionalities will be added to the map during the development of the second season.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/042aec5088f76c9bdfa912011831c9dd.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/cdf2cc847e378250bb560b1a9678bcaa.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>In addition to new locations, there will also be new characters added to the story:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/6e6cead2fd49cd77ff875a2663e029c7.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple improvements:</strong></h2><br>Season 2 improves every aspect and creates a new foundation on which each episode of this new season will be built, allowing it to take the game to a new level. Even the already known locations have had improvements which will allow to add a new layer of interactivity. (With each episode, you will see how new functionality will be added to IoM)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/b62560fafe13f03601de75654b8e79f1.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/81ba97a82c217ce342095250bfed65cf.avif?t=1723312645\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064420/extras/06bbbbd9a01b3ac3346ea